#MM- includes-amigakbd: kernel-amiga-m68k-kbd-includes
#MM- includes-amigakbd_rel : kernel-amiga-m68k-kbd-includes
#MM- kernel-amiga-m68k-kbd : kernel-amiga-m68k-kbd-includes core-linklibs linklibs-hiddstubs
#MM kernel-amiga-m68k-kbd-linklib : kernel-amiga-m68k-kbd-includes includes-hiddstubs
